 "<section class=\"page-hero page-hero--work\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"page-hero__image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"897\" src=\"assets/img/heroes/work-office.webp\" width=\"1752\"/>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Our work</span>\n<h1>Selected projects and publications</h1>\n<p>Scientific presentations, medical education programmes, stakeholder engagements and peer-reviewed publications from across the region.</p>\n</div>\n</section>",
 "<section class=\"section\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"notice\">\n<svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" width=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg>\n<p>Due to the nature of our work, most materials are confidential and covered by non-disclosure agreements. The projects below are examples we're able to share.</p>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Filter projects\" class=\"filters\" role=\"group\">\n<button aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"all\" type=\"button\">All projects</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"presentations\" type=\"button\">Scientific presentations</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"cme\" type=\"button\">CMEs and faculty management</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"stakeholder\" type=\"button\">KOL and stakeholder management</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"work-grid\">\n<article class=\"work-card\" data-category=\"presentations\">\n<div class=\"work-card__img\"><img alt=\"Diagnostic algorithm slide from the APSC heart failure consensus presentation\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/img/work/apsc-heart-failure.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"work-card__body\">\n<span class=\"work-card__tag\">Scientific presentation</span>\n<h3>APSC Consensus Statements on Chronic Heart Failure</h3>\n<p>Presentation of regional consensus recommendations, with the Asian Pacific Society of Cardiology as a direct client.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"work-card\" data-category=\"presentations\">\n<div class=\"work-card__img\"><img alt=\"Meta-analysis slide on antihypertensive agents\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/img/work/hypertension-cv-academy.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"work-card__body\">\n<span class=\"work-card__tag\">Scientific presentation</span>\n<h3>Hypertension and Macrovascular Disease</h3>\n<p>\"Minimising CV risk at work and home\" for CV Digital Academy, with Boehringer Ingelheim as a direct client.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"work-card\" data-category=\"presentations\">\n<div class=\"work-card__img\"><img alt=\"Slide showing potential genetic targets in cancer\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/img/work/ngs-presentation.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"work-card__body\">\n<span class=\"work-card__tag\">Scientific presentation</span>\n<h3>Next-Generation Sequencing</h3>\n<p>Scientific presentation on comprehensive genomic profiling (Foundation One), developed under McCann Health.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"work-card\" data-category=\"presentations\">\n<div class=\"work-card__img\"><img alt=\"Pathophysiology slide from a Parkinson's disease presentation\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/img/work/parkinsons-presentation.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"work-card__body\">\n<span class=\"work-card__tag\">Scientific presentation</span>\n<h3>Parkinson's Disease</h3>\n<p>Interactive scientific presentation on Parkinson's disease pathophysiology and progression, developed under McCann Health.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"work-card\" data-category=\"cme\">\n<div class=\"work-card__img work-card__img--photo\"><img alt=\"Group photo of pharmacists at an education programme\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/img/work/pharmacists-caravan-1.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"work-card__body\">\n<span class=\"work-card__tag\">CME programme</span>\n<h3>Pharmacists Education Programme Caravan</h3>\n<p>A multi-city education caravan for pharmacists, run in partnership with the Philippine Pharmacists Association.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"work-card\" data-category=\"cme\">\n<div class=\"work-card__img\"><img alt=\"Faculty profile slide for the CVM Congress\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/img/work/cvm-congress-faculty.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"work-card__body\">\n<span class=\"work-card__tag\">Faculty management</span>\n<h3>CVM Congress</h3>\n<p>Faculty management for a cardiovascular-metabolic congress featuring regional experts, with Boehringer Ingelheim as a direct client.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"work-card\" data-category=\"cme\">\n<div class=\"work-card__img\"><img alt=\"Slide summarising the third YATO meeting in Seoul\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/img/work/yato-congress.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"work-card__body\">\n<span class=\"work-card__tag\">Congress</span>\n<h3>Young Academy in Thoracic Oncology (YATO)</h3>\n<p>A full-day lung cancer meeting in Seoul with international faculty and almost 271 live and virtual delegates, delivered under Content Ed Net.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"work-card\" data-category=\"stakeholder\">\n<div class=\"work-card__img work-card__img--photo\"><img alt=\"Speakers on stage at the 2025 Hemophilia Summit\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/img/work/hemophilia-summit.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"work-card__body\">\n<span class=\"work-card__tag\">KOL and stakeholder management</span>\n<h3>2025 Hemophilia Summit</h3>\n<p>Bringing together medical societies and stakeholders on policy, data sharing and access to hemophilia care.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"work-card\" data-category=\"stakeholder\">\n<div class=\"work-card__img\"><img alt=\"Title slide of a study on family planning content on Facebook\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/img/work/world-contraception-day.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"work-card__body\">\n<span class=\"work-card__tag\">KOL and stakeholder management</span>\n<h3>2025 World Contraception Day Media Conference</h3>\n<p>Research on the effect of family planning and reproductive health content on Facebook, presented with the Commission on Population and Development.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
 "<section class=\"section section--tint\" id=\"publications\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Publications</span>\n<h2>Medical journal articles</h2>\n<p>Peer-reviewed publications featuring the medical writing work of Dr. Ivan Olegario.</p>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"pubs\">\n<li class=\"pub\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pub__journal\">European Cardiology Review · 2022</div>\n<p class=\"pub__title\">Asian Pacific Society of Cardiology Consensus Statements on the Diagnosis and Management of Obstructive Sleep Apnoea in Patients with Cardiovascular Disease</p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.15420/ecr.2021.59\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Read article <svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"pub\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pub__journal\">European Respiratory Journal · 2022</div>\n<p class=\"pub__title\">Randomised trial of the P2X<sub>3</sub> receptor antagonist sivopixant for refractory chronic cough</p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1183/13993003.00725-2021\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Read article <svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"pub\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pub__journal\">Surgery Today · 2022</div>\n<p class=\"pub__title\">Etiologies and treatments of chronic intestinal failure-short bowel syndrome (SBS) in Japanese adults: a real-world observational study</p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00595-022-02469-9\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Read article <svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" strok